### Стаття 15

Interaction of entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence
1. Interaction of entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence provides for:
1) mutual notification no later than one day about identified facts of domestic violence in cases provided for by this Law, in compliance with the legal regime of information with restricted access;
2) response to cases of domestic violence in accordance with competence and taking into account the assessment of risks threatening the victim;
3) coordination of measures to respond to cases of domestic violence and provision of effective assistance to victims, carried out by various entities;
4) development and implementation in accordance with competence of programs for perpetrators;
5) development and implementation in accordance with competence of programs for prevention and counteraction of domestic violence;
6) organization of implementation of measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence in accordance with competence;
7) exchange of experience in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence;
8) coordinated interdepartmental training of specialists representing entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence;
9) monitoring by specially authorized bodies in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence of compliance with the requirements of legislation by entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence, development of proposals for improvement of legislation and practice of its application.
2. Entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence involve in cooperation on organization and implementation of such measures and provision of effective assistance to victims public associations, foreign non-governmental organizations and other interested persons, and also ensure coverage of such measures and activities in media in compliance with the legal regime of information with restricted access.
3. The procedure for interaction of entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence is approved by the Cabinet of Ministers of Ukraine.
4. Entities implementing measures in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence report to the central executive body that implements state policy in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence on the results of exercising the powers defined by this Law, in the procedure determined by the central executive body that ensures the formation of state policy in the sphere of prevention and counteraction of domestic violence, which, in particular, provides for:
1) reporting by services for children affairs through the Council of Ministers of the Autonomous Republic of Crimea and local state administrations;
2) reporting by authorized units of bodies of the National Police of Ukraine through the central executive body that implements state policy in the spheres of ensuring the protection of human rights and freedoms, interests of society and the state, counteraction of crime, maintenance of public safety and order;
3) reporting by education management bodies, educational institutions and establishments of the education system through the central executive body that ensures the formation and implements state policy in the sphere of education;
4) reporting by health care bodies, institutions and establishments of health care through the central executive body that ensures the formation and implements state policy in the sphere of health care;
5) reporting by centers for provision of free legal aid through the Coordination Center for Legal Aid Provision.
{Paragraph 5 of part four of Article 15 as amended by Law No. 3022-IX of 10.04.2023}

